<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Kompas Interaktif 8 Mata Angin</title>

<script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fredoka:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
* { box-sizing: border-box; }

body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
    color: white;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #020617, #082f49, #312e81);
    min-height: 100vh;
    overflow-x: hidden;
}

.font-game { font-family: 'Fredoka', cursive; }

.glass {
    background: rgba(15, 23, 42, .78);
    backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
    border: 1px solid rgba(125, 211, 252, .25);
}

.compass {
    width: min(78vw, 360px);
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    position: relative;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 4px solid rgba(56,189,248,.65);
    background: radial-gradient(circle, #164e63 0%, #0f172a 72%);
    box-shadow: 0 0 25px #0284c766, inset 0 0 25px #0ea5e955;
    touch-action: none;
}

.compass:before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 8%;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 1px dashed rgba(125,211,252,.6);
}

.compass:after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 18%;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 1px solid rgba(251,191,36,.4);
}

.direction {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 5;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 43px;
    height: 43px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: #1e293b;
    border: 1px solid #38bdf8;
    color: #bae6fd;
    font-family: 'Fredoka', cursive;
    font-weight: 700;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: .2s;
    touch-action: manipulation;
}

.direction small {
    font-size: 9px;
    font-weight: 400;
}

.direction:hover, .direction.selected {
    background: #f59e0b;
    color: white;
    border-color: #fde68a;
    transform: scale(1.08);
    box-shadow: 0 0 16px #f59e0b88;
}

.north { top: 4%; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); background:#e11d48; color:white; }
.north:hover, .north.selected { transform: translateX(-50%) scale(1.08); }
.east { right: 4%; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%); background:#f59e0b; color:#111827; }
.east:hover, .east.selected { transform: translateY(-50%) scale(1.08); }
.south { bottom: 4%; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); background:#0284c7; color:white; }
.south:hover, .south.selected { transform: translateX(-50%) scale(1.08); }
.west { left: 4%; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%); background:#059669; color:white; }
.west:hover, .west.selected { transform: translateY(-50%) scale(1.08); }

.northeast { top: 17%; right: 17%; }
.southeast { bottom: 17%; right: 17%; }
.southwest { bottom: 17%; left: 17%; }
.northwest { top: 17%; left: 17%; }

.needle {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    z-index: 3;
    pointer-events: none;
    transition: transform .25s ease;
}

.needle-shape {
    height: 64%;
    width: 0;
    border-left: 12px solid transparent;
    border-right: 12px solid transparent;
    border-bottom: 32% solid transparent;
    position: relative;
}

.needle-top {
    position: absolute;
    width: 0;
    height: 0;
    border-left: 12px solid transparent;
    border-right: 12px solid transparent;
    border-bottom: 105px solid #fb7185;
    top: 0;
    left: -12px;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 0 5px #fb7185);
}

.needle-bottom {
    position: absolute;
    width: 0;
    height: 0;
    border-left: 12px solid transparent;
    border-right: 12px solid transparent;
    border-top: 105px solid #38bdf8;
    bottom: 0;
    left: -12px;
}

.hub {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 8;
    width: 38px;
    height: 38px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%, #fef3c7, #f59e0b, #92400e);
    border: 3px solid #0f172a;
    box-shadow: 0 0 12px #f59e0b88;
    pointer-events: none;
}

.quick-btn {
    min-width: 0;
    padding: 9px 3px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: rgba(15,23,42,.85);
    border: 1px solid #334155;
    color: #bae6fd;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    transition: .2s;
}

.quick-btn:hover, .quick-btn.selected {
    background: #0369a1;
    color: white;
    border-color: #7dd3fc;
}

@media (max-width: 400px) {
    .direction { width: 37px; height: 37px; }
    .direction small { font-size: 8px; }
    .northeast, .northwest { top: 18%; }
    .southeast, .southwest { bottom: 18%; }
    .compass { width: min(82vw, 320px); }
}
</style>
</head>

<body class="px-3 py-4 sm:px-5">

<header class="max-w-4xl mx-auto flex items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-5">
    <div class="glass rounded-2xl p-3 flex items-center gap-3">
        <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-300 to-amber-500 text-slate-900 flex items-center justify-center text-xl">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-compass"></i>
        </div>
        <div>
            <h1 class="font-game text-lg sm:text-2xl font-bold text-sky-200">
                Kompas Interaktif
            </h1>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-300">Belajar 8 Arah Mata Angin</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flex gap-1.5">
        <button id="zoomIn" aria-label="Perbesar kompas" class="glass rounded-xl w-10 h-10">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass-plus"></i>
        </button>
        <button id="zoomOut" aria-label="Perkecil kompas" class="glass rounded-xl w-10 h-10">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass-minus"></i>
        </button>
        <button id="soundBtn" aria-label="Aktifkan atau matikan suara" class="glass rounded-xl w-10 h-10 text-emerald-300">
            <i id="soundIcon" class="fa-solid fa-volume-high"></i>
        </button>
        <button id="helpBtn" aria-label="Petunjuk penggunaan" class="glass rounded-xl w-10 h-10 text-amber-300">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-question"></i>
        </button>
    </div>
</header>

<main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto flex flex-col items-center">

    <div class="text-center mb-4">
        <h2 class="font-game text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-amber-300">
            Jelajahi Arah Mata Angin!
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 mt-1">
            Tekan huruf arah atau geser jarum kompas.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div id="compassWrapper" class="my-3 transition-transform duration-200">
        <div id="compass" class="compass">

            <button class="direction north" data-dir="N" aria-label="Utara">
                U<small>0°</small>
            </button>
            <button class="direction northeast" data-dir="NE" aria-label="Timur Laut">
                TL<small>45°</small>
            </button>
            <button class="direction east" data-dir="E" aria-label="Timur">
                T<small>90°</small>
            </button>
            <button class="direction southeast" data-dir="SE" aria-label="Tenggara">
                TG<small>135°</small>
            </button>
            <button class="direction south" data-dir="S" aria-label="Selatan">
                S<small>180°</small>
            </button>
            <button class="direction southwest" data-dir="SW" aria-label="Barat Daya">
                BD<small>225°</small>
            </button>
            <button class="direction west" data-dir="W" aria-label="Barat">
                B<small>270°</small>
            </button>
            <button class="direction northwest" data-dir="NW" aria-label="Barat Laut">
                BL<small>315°</small>
            </button>

            <div id="needle" class="needle">
                <div class="needle-shape">
                    <div class="needle-top"></div>
                    <div class="needle-bottom"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="hub"></div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <p class="text-center text-xs text-slate-300 mt-3 mb-5">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-hand-pointer text-amber-300 mr-1"></i>
        Arah utara dimulai dari 0°, lalu bertambah searah jarum jam.
    </p>

    <section class="glass rounded-2xl p-4 w-full mb-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
            <div id="badge" class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-rose-600 flex items-center justify-center font-game text-3xl font-bold shrink-0">
                U
            </div>
            <div>
                <p class="text-xs text-amber-300 font-bold">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-location-arrow mr-1"></i>
                    ARAH YANG DIPILIH
                </p>
                <h2 id="directionName" class="font-game text-2xl font-bold">Utara</h2>
                <p id="degree" class="text-sm text-sky-200">0°</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-xl bg-slate-950/60 border border-slate-700 p-3">
            <p id="description" class="text-sm text-slate-200 leading-relaxed">
                Utara merupakan arah yang menjadi patokan utama pada peta dan kompas.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="w-full mb-5">
        <h3 class="font-game font-bold text-lg text-sky-200 mb-2">
            Pilih Arah Mata Angin
        </h3>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-4 sm:grid-cols-8 gap-2" id="quickDirections">
            <button class="quick-btn" data-dir="N">Utara<br>0°</button>
            <button class="quick-btn" data-dir="NE">Timur Laut<br>45°</button>
            <button class="quick-btn" data-dir="E">Timur<br>90°</button>
            <button class="quick-btn" data-dir="SE">Tenggara<br>135°</button>
            <button class="quick-btn" data-dir="S">Selatan<br>180°</button>
            <button class="quick-btn" data-dir="SW">Barat Daya<br>225°</button>
            <button class="quick-btn" data-dir="W">Barat<br>270°</button>
            <button class="quick-btn" data-dir="NW">Barat Laut<br>315°</button>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="glass rounded-2xl p-4 w-full mb-5">
        <h3 class="font-game text-lg font-bold text-amber-300 mb-2">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-lightbulb mr-2"></i>Tahukah Kamu?
        </h3>
        <ul class="text-sm text-slate-200 space-y-2">
            <li>🧭 Ada 8 arah mata angin yang dipelajari pada kompas ini.</li>
            <li>🌅 Matahari tampak terbit di sebelah timur.</li>
            <li>🌇 Matahari tampak terbenam di sebelah barat.</li>
            <li>🗺️ Arah mata angin membantu kita membaca peta dan menentukan letak suatu tempat.</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

</main>

<div id="helpModal" class="hidden fixed inset-0 z-50 bg-black/70 items-center justify-center p-4">
    <div class="glass rounded-3xl p-6 max-w-md w-full">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <h2 class="font-game text-xl font-bold text-amber-300">
                Cara Menggunakan Kompas
            </h2>
            <button id="closeHelp" aria-label="Tutup petunjuk" class="text-xl">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-xmark"></i>
            </button>
        </div>
        <ol class="list-decimal pl-5 space-y-3 text-sm text-slate-200">
            <li>Tekan tombol arah mata angin untuk melihat nama, sudut, dan keterangannya.</li>
            <li>Geser jarum kompas menggunakan jari atau mouse untuk mencoba arah yang berbeda.</li>
            <li>Gunakan tombol kaca pembesar untuk memperbesar atau memperkecil kompas.</li>
            <li>Aktifkan suara untuk mendengarkan nama arah mata angin.</li>
            <li>Ingat bahwa sudut bertambah searah jarum jam, dengan utara sebagai 0°.</li>
        </ol
